OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter describes 9/11 stair
OL,4,Aclimb as emotional
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firefighter who travelled to the
OL,7,FUnited States to take part in a stair
OL,8,Fclimb challenge to mark the 25th
OL,9,Fanniversary of 9/11 said it had been
OL,10,F"emotional".
OL,12,FRonnie Sherratt was one of eight
OL,13,Ffirefighters from Northamptonshire Fire
OL,14,Fand Rescue Service who flew to Atlanta
OL,15,Fin Georgia to take part in the event on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
