OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter describes 9/11 stair
OL,4,Aclimb as emotional
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,200 firefighters from
OL,7,Facross the world climbed 110 floors -
OL,8,Fthe same height of the World Trade
OL,9,FCenter towers - to honour the US
OL,10,Ffirefighters who died in the attacks
OL,11,Fand aftermath on 11 September 2001.
OL,13,F"This was amazing meeting up with
OL,14,Fpeople, all of us coming together, this
OL,15,Fis just brilliant," Sherratt told BBC
OL,16,FRadio Northampton's Justin Dealey.
